Package: nomnowcast
Title: Nowcasting Australian Net Overseas Migration
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("David", "Stephan", email = "david.stephan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible R pipeline for nowcasting quarterly Australian Net
    Overseas Migration (NOM) using only publicly available data. Combines
    Overseas Arrivals and Departures, ABS quarterly NOM and Department of
    Home Affairs visa grants with state-space and Bayesian state-space
    models, under a vintage-aware backtesting framework.
